cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this code or the derived data, please cite the paper below.
title: "aeromicrobiome-readbased: read-based community and gene-centric analysis of paired aerosol and source-environment metagenomes"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and derived data for a paired aerosol and source-environment
  shotgun metagenomic survey across five sites in the lower mainland of
  British Columbia spanning a
  35-fold methane range. Covers Kraken2/Bracken taxonomic profiling,
  diversity and ordination, site-blocked DESeq2 differential abundance, and
  curated marker gene profiling against a non-redundant gene catalog.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/jungsoo3436-jpg/aeromicrobiome-readbased"
keywords:
  - bioaerosols
  - microbial dispersal
  - methane oxidation
  - shotgun metagenomics
  - methanotrophy
